COPY public.health_packages (id, name, slug, description, department_id, display_order, is_active, created_at, updated_at, target_audience, heading_tone, pricing_tone, headline, pricing_note) FROM stdin;
3	Pre-Employment Screening	pre-employment-screening	Before a new employee starts, you need to know they\nare fit for the role. **Our Pre-Employment Test** covers\neverything from the basics to a full toxicology panel,\ndepending on the tier you choose. Every package \nincludes a General Consultation and a\nFit-to-Work Form.	17	2	t	2026-06-16 09:17:34.278543+01	2026-06-16 09:29:48.693884+01	Who this is for: Businesses, HR departments and\nemployers onboarding new staff.	RED	GREEN	Medical clearance for your new staff.	Fit-to-Work Form is included free in all tiers.\nToxicology is exclusively in the Premium package
2	Annual Wellness Test	annual-wellness-test-1	Most people only see a doctor when something is\nwrong. This package is for people who want to stay\nahead of it. **The Annual Wellness Test** gives you a\nthorough picture of where your health stands, from\nyour heart and liver to your kidneys, thyroid and\nbeyond. The higher the tier, the more comprehensive\nthe picture.	6	1	t	2026-06-16 08:45:36.455491+01	2026-06-16 09:30:04.013578+01	Who this is for: Individuals and families who want a\nproactive picture of their health.	GREEN	RED	A full picture of your health, once a year	Female pricing is higher in most tiers due to inclusion\nof Mammogram, Breast Scan and PAP Smear. PSA is\nmost relevant for male patients and is included from\nDeluxe upward.
1	Annual Wellness Test	annual-wellness-test	Most people only see a doctor when something is\nwrong. This package is for people who want to stay\nahead of it. **The Annual Wellness Test** gives you a\nthorough picture of where your health stands, from\nyour heart and liver to your kidneys, thyroid and\nbeyond. The higher the tier, the more comprehensive\nthe picture.	5	0	f	2026-04-29 20:23:36.705284+01	2026-06-15 14:22:58.061677+01	Who this is for: Individuals and families who want a\nproactive picture of their health.	GREEN	RED	A full picture of your health, once a year	Female pricing is higher in most tiers due to inclusion\nof Mammogram, Breast Scan and PAP Smear. PSA is\nmost relevant for male patients and is included from\nDeluxe upward.
4	Annual Wellness Test	annual-wellness-test-2	Hiring a driver, nanny, cook or guard is a decision that\ndeserves proper due diligence. **Our Domestic Staff Screening**\ngives you the health information you need before they star	6	3	t	2026-06-16 09:32:02.008229+01	2026-06-16 09:38:49.17787+01	Who this is for: Homeowners and families hiring domestic\nworkers in Lagos.	RED	GREEN	Know who you are bringing to your home.	Male pricing is lower in Standard and above due to\nexclusion of Abdomino-Pelvic Scan.
5	Food Handlers Test	food-handlers-test	Food handlers in Nigeria are required to hold valid\nhealth certifications. **Our Food Handlers Test** covers\nall the necessary checks and provides the\ndocumentation your business needs. A Fit-to-Work\nForm is included free from Standard+ upward.	6	4	t	2026-06-16 09:40:42.192831+01	2026-06-16 10:01:02.272121+01	Who this is for: Restaurants, hotels, catering\nbusinesses and any establishment employing food\nhandlers.	RED	GREEN	Keep your kitchen and your customers safe.	Fit-to-Work Form is included free from Standard+\nupward.
\.
